00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:44.940
gravity is force times distance and the work done by the force of friction is force times distance.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:50.380
The forces are the same because it&#x27;s travelling at a constant speed. So the forces are the same.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:56.720
